    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103877" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηρ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>observant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.5.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκολουθία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					8.288
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.Lond.
				36.49
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. αἵρεσις, τ. ἄνδρες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπειρική</span>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοί</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Sect.Intr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>needing to be observed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.108
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>by observation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>retaining</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸς τ. θυσιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.151
				</span></i>
			; <i>preservative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.Did.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ὑγιαίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.42
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Theol.Ar.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
